    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n49070" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">trĭĕtērĭcus</span></b> ,
			a, um, adj., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τριετηρικός,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>recurring every
				three years</i>, <i>triennial</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sacra,</span>”
				<i>the festival of Bacchus</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Ov. M.
					6, 587</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">also called trieterica orgia,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					A. 4, 302</span></i>
			. —As <i>subst.</i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">trĭĕtērĭca</span></b> ,
				ōrum, n., <i>the festival of Bacchus</i>, <i><span class="en">Ov. R. Am.
				593</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Stat. Th. 2, 661</span></i>;
				<i><span class="en">id. Achill. 1, 595</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Hyg. Fab.
				131</span></i>; cf. trieteris.</div>
